// A major pentatonic (A B C# E F#) at frets 2-5: the minor box-1 shape, three frets lower.
// From the root A (pinky, string 6 fret 5) up to the top A and back down, in 8ths.
\title "A major pentatonic at fret 2"
\tempo 100
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
